  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 and resnet50, using transformer aggregation and weighted fusion, achieve high accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests whether replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a stronger image encoder) while keeping other components (scvi_n200, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) the same would improve performance. This isolates the impact of the image encoder, a critical design choice, and leverages the strong prior evidence for the RNA encoder and fusion method."
}

